WEBVTT

00:05.080 --> 00:06.120
Yes

00:06.200 --> 00:08.320
Proceed to Jingning Palace

00:19.360 --> 00:20.760
So beautiful

00:23.960 --> 00:24.920
Alright

00:25.000 --> 00:27.667
There's a lantern festival in the city tonight

00:27.960 --> 00:29.960
Have your second brother take you

00:30.440 --> 00:31.840
Yes, Father

00:44.000 --> 00:45.480
Yu'er is clever and elegant

00:45.560 --> 00:46.960
Grows more like you

00:48.080 --> 00:48.880
Pitiful

00:48.960 --> 00:50.360
Beauty fades, love wanes

00:50.560 --> 00:52.080
Some people came today

00:52.200 --> 00:54.200
Only brought gifts for the daughter

00:54.600 --> 00:56.267
Then what do you want?

00:56.960 --> 00:58.360
I

00:58.720 --> 01:00.880
Want Your Majesty to come closer
